DISTRIBUTION MODEL

Cadenza is commercially licensed under TWO distinct models:

  1. HOSTED SaaS — Starter, Professional and Enterprise PA plans.
     The customer accesses the software as a service hosted by the Author
     or an authorised reseller, under the SaaS Terms of Service signed
     at subscription.

  2. SELF-HOST — on-premise installation, with source code access,
     periodic updates and documentation, under a per-institution license
     agreement signed separately.

Pricing, plan details and competitive benchmarks are documented in the
commercial deliverables "Proposta.md" (v2.2) and "Cadenza_Presentazione_
Direzione.pdf", which are kept outside this repository and made available
on request.

